§5§5     *MissPortinari*§r
#- §5Dear Craftadian's,

§dIt is my duty to inform you that trapdoor's on §5/warp deathcap§r §dare the property of §5Deathcap™§r.

§dThey are, therefore, under no circumstances to be opened, flipped or to be subject to other ownership.
#- §dAny attempts to disobey is considered a violation of article §86.66 of The Order Of The Spyglass Constitution§r §dand shall be punishable by death, or worse, expulsion and all it entails. I may be willing to turn a blind eye on these acts of vandalism as long as all trapdoor's are§d
#- §dun-flipped and put back in the right place. It is also my duty to remind you that on an island '§osuch as this one§0§d', it's best to leave things alone for stupid health and safety purposes. Or death will be the result... regardless.

To the culprit, please
#- §dnote that we do not know whom you're planning to impress with this strange obsession. We recommend seeking professional therapy.
I sincerely hope this will be cleared up soon. I allow '§4The Trapdoor Bandit§d' time to reconsider their actions before an offical inquiry and a
#- §dmanhunt is ordered.

I shall make sure you pay for this in blood.
Or maybe a wanted poster 'dead or alive'.
Or maybe when we find you, you can become a lab rat for Dr. Link.
§0-------------------
§o§8§oMissPortinari§0
Chief Executive Officer
§5Deathcap™
