#- §8have a '§odevil on your shoulder§r' as they §8also say... can you blame me? I thought... §owe§r thought, we were§r §8doing the right thing by giving Fern a chance to see her own future. It only made things worse. Now they are trapped in darkness, stuck in the fate that I have been trying to avoid.§r§r
#- §8Running away from my own hell has created a brand new one. Craftadia need's to be fixed! But how? I can't undo everything, and i'm not so sure this world should be fixed the more I think about it. This was my home. This was my life. It still is, just not the same as it was. I'm not the same as I was.§r
